<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
        <PackageId>X3Code.Wasm.Utils</PackageId>
        <Product>X3Code.Wasm.Utils</Product>
        <Title>X3-Code WASM Utilities</Title>
        <Description>Utilities and helpers for Blazor WASM</Description>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>10.0.0: New version scheme - the major now tracks the .NET generation the package is built for (net10.0), the minor carries features and breaking changes, the patch carries fixes. All X3Code packages move to 10.0.0 together.
The package now ships its XML documentation, so consumers get IntelliSense. Added an MIT license expression, a README and a symbol package (snupkg) with SourceLink.
Microsoft.JSInterop 10.0.3 -> 10.0.11.

1.8.5: last version was missing nullables, nuget package updates
1.8.2: NuGet package updates
1.8.0: Update to .NET8</PackageReleaseNotes>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
      <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.JSInterop" />
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>
